ess_scope: [] (no process specified).\nrequested_tools: [].\nrequested_validation_level: unspecified (no validation requested? They request \"标记待验证事项\" not validation level maybe no actual validation. Unspecified).\nliterature_query: no explicit literature target. empty string.\nbudget: -1,-1, notes maybe [] or note \"没有元素价格和性能实测数据\"? That's not budget. notes [].\nclarification_needed: false? Need assess. There are no hard conflicts. Candidate count clear. Cost qualitative no numeric not blocking. Allowed/forbidden no conflict? allowed Ti Al V Fe; forbidden Ta Nb no overlap. Good.\nclarification_questions: [].\nunparsed_requirements: Maybe \"没有元素价格和性能实测数据，说明定性取舍，并标记待验证事项\" is not unparsed, it's instruction about output. Could include in assumptions or unparsed? It can be handled as notes? We can put in assumptions? Need \"说明定性取舍\" maybe no element price data. Since this node doesn't output qualitative tradeoffs, but can mark assumption. Perhaps unparsed_requirements include \"说明定性取舍，并标记待验证事项\" because it's not a design constraint but a requirement for downstream? But it's parsed as an instruction. The JSON schema doesn't have field for verification items. Could put in assumptions: \"用户声明无元素价格和性能实测数据，成本目标仅作定性取舍，相关结论需标记待验证\". This captures. Also \"待验证事项\" maybe unparsed? It's not unparsed. Better assumptions include.\n\nAssumptions:\n- \"未指定应用场景细化行业，按一般工业结构件处理并归入 other。\"\n- \"成分单位用户明确为 wt.%，总和 100%。\"\n- \"Ti 为基体且未给出具体含量，按余量处理，不新增数值约束。\"\n- \"未指定候选数量以外细节...\" candidate count specified 2.\n- \"未指定加工工艺、工具和验证等级，分别采用空范围和 unspecified。\"\n- \"用户声明没有元素价格和性能实测数据，成本目标仅作定性取舍，相关结论需标记待验证。\"\n\nMaybe \"只允许 Ti、Al、V、Fe\" implies allowed elements. Also \"Ti为基体\" but allowed. Should we add assumption Ti balance. Yes.\n\nNeed ensure top-level only fields. JSON valid. All strings arrays.\n\nPotential issue: scenario_id could be lightweight_structure? \"一般工业结构件\" is structural, but not lightweight. The scenario_id \"other\" with description. Good.\n\ntask_type cost_constrained. yes.\n\n